      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i think something is wrong with my smart home setup. ive noticed my thermostat keeps dropping like 3 degrees at exactly 2am and my hue lights shift to this weird dim amber shade every tuesday around midnight. i dont have any schedules set for this. it feels way too specific to just be a glitch... like someone is messing with them from outside. do you think there's a way i can track the login history or see if a specific device is being remotely accessed?",
